<tab><cl=F0F010>MANTRAS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>A mantra is a leaflet with a magic spell. The spell "pronounced" by your character leads to some magical effect that changes the character's characteristics or gives him additional capabilities. Some mantras can only work with a certain level of <l="hts:\\language\i_charact.hts">karma of</l> your character. Mantras can be found or bought. To be able to use a mantra repeatedly, it must be "memorized" with the help of a <l="hts:\\language\mantrabook.hts">Book of Mantras</l>.<br>
}